## Kafka Topic Map (How Services Talk)

```mermaid
graph LR
    CS[Claim Service] -->|loan.requested| SO[Saga Orchestrator]
    SO -->|contribution.command.lock_funds| CON[Contribution Service]
    CON -->|contribution.event.funds_locked| SO
    SO -->|payment.command.disburse| PAY[Payment Service]
    PAY -->|payment.event.disbursed| SO
    PAY -->|payment.event.failed| SO
    SO -->|contribution.command.unlock_funds| CON
    SO -->|notification.command.send| NOT[Notification Engine]
    SO -->|review.command.prompt| REV[Review Service]
    EDU[Education Service] -->|gamification.events| REW[Rewards Service]
    EVT[Event Service] -->|gamification.events| REW
```

